{"ref":"BDB, פָּרִיץ","hw":"פָּרִיץ","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">פָּרִיץ</span></big>  <strong>n.m. violent one</strong> (robber, murderer);—<span dir=\"rtl\">פ׳ שֹׁפֵךְ דָּם</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 18:10\" href=\"/Ezekiel.18.10\">Ez 18:10</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אָרְחוֹת פ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 17:4\" href=\"/Psalms.17.4\">ψ 17:4</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">פָּרִיצִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 7:22\" href=\"/Ezekiel.7.22\">Ez 7:22</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מְעָרַת פָּרִצִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 7:11\" href=\"/Jeremiah.7.11\">Je 7:11</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּנֵי פָּרִיצֵי עַמְּךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 11:14\" href=\"/Daniel.11.14\">Dn 11:14</a>; of wild beast, <span dir=\"rtl\">פְּרִיץ חַיּוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 35:9\" href=\"/Isaiah.35.9\">Is 35:9</a>.","next":"BDB, פרץ","prev":"BDB, פַּרְצִי"}